WEBVTT

01:08:56.875 --> 01:09:00.351
Accenture, BetterUp, Hilton and SAP.

01:09:00.375 --> 01:09:04.143
Thanks to TED for hosting our discussion
and to Esther Perel for joining.

01:09:04.167 --> 01:09:05.768
And thanks to you for listening.

01:09:05.792 --> 01:09:07.184
If you liked what you heard,

01:09:07.208 --> 01:09:09.684
we'd love it if you could
rate and review the show,

01:09:09.708 --> 01:09:11.000
it helps people find us.